{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And when you assemble the assembly.</b> Rashi's comment: 'Is it possible that just as for the journeying of the camps one blows tekia and terua and tekia, so too for assembling the assembly?' etc. In most commentaries it is written thus, and the phrasing is abbreviated. This is what it says: Is it possible that just as for the journeying of the camps one blows tekia and terua and tekia, so too for assembling the assembly — the same? And from here, there is no difference between assembling the assembly and the journeying of the camps, etc."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:13.036991829Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}